},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"埃迪蒂难得拜访营地。","tag":"tag_4"},{"text":"我当然得做好欢迎你的准备了。","tag":"tag_4"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[cm][show]原来如此，{myName}有心了。其实不必这么大费周章地欢迎我，能拜访{myName}我就已经满足了。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]不过既然你已经细心准备了那么多，那么我也不会拒绝你的。就当做是我们上次在大市集成功捉住贼人的庆功宴吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]（两人在篝火前准备食物……）[l][cm]","charaName":"","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]嗯……先放调料、然后翻转烤火，应该是这么做的。自从你上次推荐我美食以后，我在巡逻换班歇息的空隙就会留意那间店是怎么做烤肉的。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]不过比起他们，我的厨艺还是比较拙劣的，希望{myName}能喜欢。来，这是给你的烤肉，能让{myName}赏脸吃我的食物，是我的荣幸。[l]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"能吃到埃迪蒂亲手做的食物，","tag":"tag_10"},{"text":"怎么想都是我的荣幸才对。","tag":"tag_10"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[cm][show]你这话说的……而且和{myName}相处的时候，我才会放下治安队队长的身份。[l]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"放下治安队队长的身份？","tag":"tag_12"},{"text":"这话怎么说？","tag":"tag_12"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[cm][show]在和{myName}一同休息的时光过后，我就一直思考着自己该如何继续前进。到后来我想明白了，那就是该拿起的时候拿起，该放下的时候放下。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]你之前说过，停下脚步不失为一种前进的方法。我就想到了自己太累的原因是否因为自己一直放不下治安队队长这个身份。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]虽然我认为治安队队长这个身份给了我前进的动力，但给了我许多压力。我应该在是适当的时候放松一下自己，可过去的我从没有想去做这件事。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_48"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"action\": \"bubble\",\r  \"para\": {\r    \"bubbles\": {\r      \"chara041_1\": \"04\"\r    }\r  }\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"text":"[show]但自从和你一起聊天以后，我就能感受到自己的压力小了许多，只要有你的陪伴，我就感受到从未有过的轻松感。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]所以我才会想和你一起去贫民街看一看，看一看我的过去，看一看我最初想要的究竟是什么。而当我想起我最初的想法的那一刻，就是我解开心结、重归平静的时候。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]现在回想起来，之前是我过于注重效率和责任导致自己的剑法过于急躁紊乱，才导致自己卡在瓶颈之中。我无论再多计算，也终究是人，终究需要放下执着。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]而当我心境平稳、意志坚定的时候……我才能完全展现自己的力量。当然，你的陪伴也是不可缺少的。[l]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":0.6,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"能变强是埃迪蒂自己的功劳啦。","tag":"tag_20"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[cm][show]{myName}还是一如既往的谦虚呢，果然这才是强者必须拥有的品性吧。看来我要学习的东西还有很多。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]不过在这之前……我还有一件事情，想要{myName}见证一下。[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_41"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"pause\": false\r  },\r  \"action\": \"gamePause\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","noIn":false,"x":276,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-325,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","noIn":false,"x":-500,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5,"bright":1,"layer":"bg","y":-125,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_50"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"action\": \"npcMove\",\r  \"para\": {\r    \"speed\": 3,\r    \"points\": [\r      {\r        \"y\": -26.65,\r        \"x\": 7.70\r      }\r    ],\r    \"direction\": 1,\r    \"lockDirection\": 0,\r    \"lockAnim\": \"walk_front\",\r    \"heroType\": 0,\r    \"npc\": \"add_fav_hero_041_5\"\r  }\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_51"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"time":800,"type":"time"},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"num\": 1,\r    \"npc\": \"add_fav_hero_041_5\",\r    \"loop\": false,\r    \"heroType\": 0,\r    \"anime\": \"birth_boss\"\r  },\r  \"action\": \"npcAnimePlay\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_54"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"time":1000,"type":"time"},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"k